-- 0008_question_bank_v2.sql
-- Bar Exam question bank v2 (13 Oct 2026): an easier mix.
--   150 easy, 100 medium, 50 expert, plus 6 "Off the Runway" fun questions
--   (stored as easy, category 'Off the Runway').
-- Keeps the fixes to E036, E037, M068 and M082 from 0006.
-- Retires every question not in this list (X051-X100, F003 and anything
-- older); retired questions are kept, not deleted, because past games
-- point at them. Safe to re-run.

